  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to incorporate the following S3 configurations (actually, just s3-file and s3-mysql) to the fcrepo-configs module in the core codebase.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud/tree/master/src/cloud/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/config"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud/tree/master/src/cloud/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/config",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The S3 Binary Storage option has been made available in ModeShape as of 5.2.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Additionally:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. This capability should not be merged until specific performance implications are tested and understood.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Once this ticket has been completed, a follow-on ticket should be made for adding a new wiki page documenting how to set up the S3 configuration.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
