  "description": "<p>This task is to incorporate the following S3 configurations (actually, just s3-file and s3-mysql) to the fcrepo-configs module in the core codebase.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud/tree/master/src/cloud/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/config\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud/tree/master/src/cloud/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/config</a></p>\n\n<p>The S3 Binary Storage option has been made available in ModeShape as of 5.2.</p>\n\n<p>Additionally:<br/>\n1. This capability should not be merged until specific performance implications are tested and understood.<br/>\n2. Once this ticket has been completed, a follow-on ticket should be made for adding a new wiki page documenting how to set up the S3 configuration.</p>\n",
